     You know, NetHack actually got a lot more interesting this time
around. I hadn't expected to last too long anyway, and getting down to
DL-24 before forgetting my starting spells (19239 turns) while
backtracking and trying to figure stuff out seems pretty good to me.
Still, I'dve liked to have gotten to the castle -- my god told me both
that a tune was needed and the tune to use.
     This time around I saw no liches, mindflayers, eels, or even
dragons (except myself and the progeny, of course). Lots of minor
demons and incubi/succubi, though... really annoying when one turned
invisible on me before a throne gave me clear vision, though my
character actually enjoyed it that time, compared to the times before
when she actually saw what she was doing. :P

